  _category: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8b7b72a809a05de42b9e4e1a9fc3d116, type: 2}
  _glyph: "\U0001F33D\uFE0F"
  _subtitle: Hopes for brains
  _description: Stuffed with straw and set up in a [[e40fea6d-99ae-4dd4-8af1-1f7cbd1dd3eb|Scarecrow's
    Cornfield]] to frighten the crows, who were not frightened at all. [[bff2dcff-df4c-46a2-a793-2f30f4a6a243|Dorothy
    Gale]] lifts him off his pole, and he joins her to ask the Wizard for [[76e18d10-2bf0-4a20-91ef-ad04491e3893|Brains]].
    Later he rules the [[9d4c77c2-5244-4449-b2ef-0ed428ada08e|Emerald City]].
  _sortOrder: 2
